			// currentOwner is null. Distinguish "org list still loading" from
			// "genuinely belongs to no org". Without a synchronous personalOrgSlug
			// (session.user.username), currentOwner only resolves once
			// `/api/organizations` settles. Redirecting to settings before then
			// (with replace) unmounts this route and strands the user, because the
			// org list arrives too late to re-trigger this effect. Wait for
			// orgsReady so users with a personal org land on it.
			if (orgsReady) {
